{"1697850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rose and Locket", "steam_appid": 1697850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HAND-DRAWN ACTION ADVENTURE THAT PLAYS LIKE A LIVING GRAPHIC NOVEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose's daughter has been taken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her, Rose must descend into the Underwest - a strange frontier beyond death where lost souls wander, ancient powers rule, and the Seven Deadly Sins hold dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a beautifully illustrated underworld, brought to life as a living graphic novel. Uncover powerful new abilities, and challenge the monstrous embodiments of Sin in a journey driven by love, sacrifice, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/817fcf921fc2305ed56bd02a9a1f5916.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/817fcf921fc2305ed56bd02a9a1f5916.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/817fcf921fc2305ed56bd02a9a1f5916.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST, RESPONSIVE ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tight platforming and skill-based combat as you battle your way deeper into the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chain together movement abilities to traverse dangerous terrain and evade devastating attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Master a growing arsenal of weapons and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face increasingly dangerous challenges that test your reflexes and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stay on the offensive with fast-paced combat that rewards precision and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is designed to keep you moving, adapting, and improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b3f05f0b0a18c526de2916c2b95ae155.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b3f05f0b0a18c526de2916c2b95ae155.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b3f05f0b0a18c526de2916c2b95ae155.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNT THE SEVEN DEADLY SINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rulers of the Underwest have stolen countless souls - including your daughter's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down and confront towering bosses inspired by the Seven Deadly Sins, each commanding their own domain, enemies, and twisted philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From towering monstrosities to cunning manipulators, every Sin presents a unique challenge that will push your skills to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them and uncover the truth behind the Underwest itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/474495c3a5a45260c9aaa9155d3f1d49.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/474495c3a5a45260c9aaa9155d3f1d49.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/474495c3a5a45260c9aaa9155d3f1d49.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE THROUGH THE UNDERWEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world inspired by graphic novels, western folklore, and dark fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through forgotten ghost towns, cursed frontiers, haunted wastelands, and surreal realms shaped by the rulers who control them. Every region introduces new enemies, challenges, secrets, and dangers waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/c043c869eb835713bb471f7ae40ca375.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/c043c869eb835713bb471f7ae40ca375.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/c043c869eb835713bb471f7ae40ca375.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to experience Rose's journey or master every challenge the Underwest has to offer, you can tailor the adventure to suit your preferred level of difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy Mode for players who want to focus on exploration, story, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Medium Mode for a balanced action-adventure experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hard Mode for those seeking demanding combat and intense encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/e7d5fbb1515ea334d88abd4d467e150b.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/e7d5fbb1515ea334d88abd4d467e150b.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/e7d5fbb1515ea334d88abd4d467e150b.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD BROUGHT TO LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a hand-crafted world presented like a living graphic novel, blending expressive animation, bold visual storytelling, and richly illustrated environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hand-crafted environments and expressive character art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dynamic comic-inspired presentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully voiced characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Underwest isn't just a place to survive, it's a world filled with stories waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/cf2a84738ac8722bc820698c6f457895.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/cf2a84738ac8722bc820698c6f457895.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/cf2a84738ac8722bc820698c6f457895.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A MOTHER'S JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the action lies a personal story of grief, devotion, and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose will cross the boundaries of life and death itself to bring her daughter home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Rose journeys deeper into the underworld, long-buried truths from her past begin to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Underwest has claimed countless souls. Will Rose's daughter be next?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HAND-DRAWN ACTION ADVENTURE THAT PLAYS LIKE A LIVING GRAPHIC NOVEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose's daughter has been taken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her, Rose must descend into the Underwest - a strange frontier beyond death where lost souls wander, ancient powers rule, and the Seven Deadly Sins hold dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a beautifully illustrated underworld, brought to life as a living graphic novel. Uncover powerful new abilities, and challenge the monstrous embodiments of Sin in a journey driven by love, sacrifice, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/817fcf921fc2305ed56bd02a9a1f5916.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/817fcf921fc2305ed56bd02a9a1f5916.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/817fcf921fc2305ed56bd02a9a1f5916.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST, RESPONSIVE ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tight platforming and skill-based combat as you battle your way deeper into the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chain together movement abilities to traverse dangerous terrain and evade devastating attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Master a growing arsenal of weapons and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face increasingly dangerous challenges that test your reflexes and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stay on the offensive with fast-paced combat that rewards precision and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is designed to keep you moving, adapting, and improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b3f05f0b0a18c526de2916c2b95ae155.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b3f05f0b0a18c526de2916c2b95ae155.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b3f05f0b0a18c526de2916c2b95ae155.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNT THE SEVEN DEADLY SINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rulers of the Underwest have stolen countless souls - including your daughter's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down and confront towering bosses inspired by the Seven Deadly Sins, each commanding their own domain, enemies, and twisted philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From towering monstrosities to cunning manipulators, every Sin presents a unique challenge that will push your skills to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them and uncover the truth behind the Underwest itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/474495c3a5a45260c9aaa9155d3f1d49.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/474495c3a5a45260c9aaa9155d3f1d49.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/474495c3a5a45260c9aaa9155d3f1d49.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE THROUGH THE UNDERWEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world inspired by graphic novels, western folklore, and dark fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through forgotten ghost towns, cursed frontiers, haunted wastelands, and surreal realms shaped by the rulers who control them. Every region introduces new enemies, challenges, secrets, and dangers waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/c043c869eb835713bb471f7ae40ca375.poster.avif?t=1782439245\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/c043c869eb835713bb471f7ae40ca375.webm?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/c043c869eb835713bb471f7ae40ca375.mp4?t=1782439245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to experience Rose's journey or master every challenge the Underwest has to offer, you can tailor the adventure to suit your preferred level of difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy Mode for players who want to focus on exploration, story, and discove